msgstr ""
"Library: Blueprints - CloudFormation (Anteriormente Provisioning: Blueprints"
" - CloudFormation)"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:497
msgid ""
"Determines access to CloudFormation-type Blueprints on the |LibBluApp| page."
" The \"Provision\" permission allows for provisioning Apps from "
