"esta permissão, o tipo de blueprint Helm está disponível."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:505
msgid ""
"This permission is recommended for those responsible for defining Helm "
"blueprints."
msgstr ""
"Esta permissão é recomendada para those responsible for defining Helm "
"blueprints."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:507
msgid ""
"Library: Blueprints - Kubernetes (Formerly Provisioning: Blueprints - "
"Kubernetes)"
msgstr ""
"Library: Blueprints - Kubernetes (Anteriormente Provisioning: Blueprints - "
"Kubernetes)"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:509
msgid ""
"Determines access to Kubernetes-type Blueprints on the |LibBluApp| page. The"
" \"Provision\" permission allows for provisioning Apps from Kubernetes "
"Blueprints without the ability to create or edit them."
msgstr ""
"Determina o acesso a Kubernetes-type Blueprints on the |LibBluApp| page. The"
" \"Provision\" permission allows for provisioning Apps from Kubernetes "
"Blueprints without the ability to create or edit them."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:510
msgid ""
"The Blueprints page allows for the creation of pre-configured, multi-tier "
"application definitions which can be deployed via the Apps page. With this "
"permission the blueprint type of Kubernetes is available."
msgstr ""
"A página Blueprints permite a criação de definições de aplicações multi-"
"camada pré-configuradas que podem ser implantadas via a página Apps. Com "
