#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:511
msgid ""
"This permission is recommended for those responsible for defining Kubernetes"
" blueprints."
msgstr ""
"Esta permissão é recomendada para those responsible for defining Kubernetes "
"blueprints."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:513
msgid ""
"Library: Blueprint - Terraform (Formerly Provisioning: Blueprints - "
"Terraform)"
msgstr ""
"Library: Blueprint - Terraform (Anteriormente Provisioning: Blueprints - "
"Terraform)"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:515
msgid ""
"Determines access to Terraform-type Blueprints on the |LibBluApp| page. The "
"\"Provision\" permission allows for provisioning Apps from Terraform "
"Blueprints without the ability to create or edit them."
msgstr ""
"Determina o acesso a Terraform-type Blueprints on the |LibBluApp| page. The "
"\"Provision\" permission allows for provisioning Apps from Terraform "
"Blueprints without the ability to create or edit them."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:516
msgid ""
"The Blueprints page allows for the creation of pre-configured, multi-tier "
"application definitions which can be deployed via the Apps page. With this "
"permission the blueprint type of Terraform is available."
msgstr ""
"A página Blueprints permite a criação de definições de aplicações multi-"
"camada pré-configuradas que podem ser implantadas via a página Apps. Com "
"esta permissão, o tipo de blueprint Terraform está disponível."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:517
msgid ""
"This permission is recommended for those responsible for defining Terraform "
"blueprints."
msgstr ""
"Esta permissão é recomendada para those responsible for defining Terraform "
"blueprints."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:519
msgid "Library: Catalog Items (Formerly Tools: Self Service)"
msgstr "Library: Catalog Items (Anteriormente Tools: Self Service)"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:521
msgid "Determines access to |LibBluCat|"
msgstr "Determina o acesso a |LibBluCat|"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:522
msgid ""
"|LibBluCat| allows administrators to configure Catalog Items for the Library"
" Catalog and Self Service Persona users"
msgstr ""
"|LibBluCat| permite que administradores configurem Itens de Catálogo para o "
"Catálogo da Biblioteca e usuários da Persona Self Service"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:523
msgid ""
"This permission is recommended for those responsible for creating and "
"managing Library Catalog Items."
msgstr ""
"Esta permissão é recomendada para those responsible for creating and "
"managing Library Catalog Items."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:525
msgid "Library: Instance Types (Formerly Provisioning: Library)"
msgstr "Library: Instance Types (Anteriormente Provisioning: Library)"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:527
msgid "Determines access to the |LibBluIns|"
msgstr "Determina o acesso a the |LibBluIns|"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:528
msgid "|LibBluIns| is where Instance Types are created and maintained."
msgstr "|LibBluIns| é onde os Tipos de Instância são criados e mantidos."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:529
msgid ""
"This permission is recommended for those responsible for managing the "
"Instance Types."
msgstr ""
"Esta permissão é recomendada para those responsible for managing the "
"Instance Types."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:531
msgid "Library: Integrations (Formerly Provisioning: Automation Integrations)"
msgstr ""
"Library: Integrations (Anteriormente Provisioning: Automation Integrations)"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:533
msgid "Determines access to |LibInt|."
msgstr "Determina o acesso a |LibInt|."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:534
msgid ""
"|LibInt| is where Library Automation created and maintained.. These include "
"Chef, Puppet, Ansible, Ansible Tower and vRealize Orchestrator."
msgstr ""
"|LibInt| é onde a Automação da Biblioteca é criada e mantida. Estes incluem "
"Chef, Puppet, Ansible, Ansible Tower e vRealize Orchestrator."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:535
msgid ""
"This permission is recommended for those responsible for the integration "
"between |morpheus| and integrated automation technologies."
msgstr ""
"Esta permissão é recomendada para those responsible for the integration "
"between |morpheus| and integrated automation technologies."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:537
msgid "Library: Packages"
msgstr "Library: Packages"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:539
msgid "Determines access to |LibTemClu|."
msgstr "Determina o acesso a |LibTemClu|."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:540
msgid ""
"|LibTemClu| is where Cluster Packages are created or edited. Cluster "
"Packages are associated with Cluster Layouts"
msgstr ""
"|LibTemClu| é onde Pacotes de Cluster são criados ou editados. Pacotes de "
"Cluster são associados a Layouts de Cluster"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:541
msgid ""
"This permission is recommended for those responsible for Cluster Layout "
"templating"
msgstr ""
"Esta permissão é recomendada para those responsible for Cluster Layout "
"templating"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:543
msgid "Library: Options"
msgstr "Library: Options"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:545
msgid ""
"Determines access to |LibOpt| - Inputs (Option Types) and Option Lists."
msgstr ""
"Determina o acesso a |LibOpt| - Inputs (Option Types) and Option Lists."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:547
msgid ""
"This permission is recommended for those responsible for creating and "
"managing Library Inputs (Option Types) and Option Lists."
msgstr ""
"Esta permissão é recomendada para those responsible for creating and "
"managing Library Inputs (Option Types) and Option Lists."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:549
msgid ""
"Library: Scheduling - Execute (Formerly Provisioning: Scheduling - Execute)"
msgstr ""
"Library: Scheduling - Execute (Anteriormente Provisioning: Scheduling - "
"Execute)"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:551
msgid "Determines access to |LibAutExe|."
msgstr "Determina o acesso a |LibAutExe|."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:552
msgid ""
"The Execute Scheduling is where time schedules for Jobs, including Task, "
"Workflow, and Backup Jobs are created and managed."
msgstr ""
"O Execute Scheduling é onde agendamentos para Jobs, incluindo Task, Workflow"
" e Backup Jobs, são criados e gerenciados."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:553
msgid ""
"This permission is recommended for those responsible to create and manage "
"schedules to be selected when scheduling jobs."
msgstr ""
"Esta permissão é recomendada para those responsible to create and manage "
"schedules to be selected when scheduling jobs."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:555
msgid ""
"Library: Scheduling - Power (Formerly Provisioning: Scheduling - Power)"
msgstr ""
"Library: Scheduling - Power (Anteriormente Provisioning: Scheduling - Power)"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:557
msgid "Determines access to |LibAutPow|."
msgstr "Determina o acesso a |LibAutPow|."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:558
msgid ""
"Power Scheduling is where startup and shutdown times are created, these "
"schedules can be applied via policy or manaully."
msgstr ""
"Power Scheduling é onde horários de inicialização e desligamento são "
"criados; esses agendamentos podem ser aplicados via política ou manualmente."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:559
msgid ""
"This permission is recommended for those responsible to create and manage "
"power schedules."
msgstr ""
"Esta permissão é recomendada para those responsible to create and manage "
"power schedules."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:561
msgid "Library: Tasks (Formerly Provisioning: Tasks)"
msgstr "Library: Tasks (Anteriormente Provisioning: Tasks)"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:563
msgid "Determines access to |LibAutTas| and |LibAutWor|."
msgstr "Determina o acesso a |LibAutTas| and |LibAutWor|."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:564
msgid ""
"|LibAutTas| is where Tasks are created and managed. |LibAutWor| is where "
"Workflows are created and managed. Workflows are used to execute one or many"
" tasks during specified phases."
msgstr ""
"|LibAutTas| é onde as Tarefas são criadas e gerenciadas. |LibAutWor| é onde "
"os Workflows são criados e gerenciados. Workflows são usados para executar "
"uma ou muitas tarefas durante fases especificadas."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:565
msgid ""
"This permission is recommended for those responsible for creating "
"provisioning and operational scripts."
msgstr ""
"Esta permissão é recomendada para those responsible for creating "
"provisioning and operational scripts."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:567
msgid ""
"Library: Tasks - Script Engines (Formerly Provisioning: Tasks - Script "
"Engines)"
msgstr ""
"Library: Tasks - Script Engines (Anteriormente Provisioning: Tasks - Script "
"Engines)"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:569
msgid "Determines access to **Execute Target** of **Local** for Tasks."
msgstr "Determina o acesso a **Execute Target** of **Local** for Tasks."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:570
msgid ""
"This permission limits Tasks from being able to run on the Morpheus "
"appliance(s).  Additionally, Task Types that only contain the **Execute "
"Target** of **Local** will be removed, such as: Groovy, Javascript, and "
"Python Task Types."
msgstr ""
"Esta permissão limita as Tarefas de serem executadas no(s) appliance(s) "
"Morpheus. Além disso, Tipos de Tarefa que contêm apenas o **Execute Target**"
" de **Local** serão removidos, como: Tipos de Tarefa Groovy, Javascript e "
"Python."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:571
msgid ""
"This permission is recommended for those responsible for Tasks that may need"
" to execute on the appliance(s)."
msgstr ""
"Esta permissão é recomendada para those responsible for Tasks that may need "
"to execute on the appliance(s)."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:573
msgid "Library: Templates"
msgstr "Library: Templates"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:575
msgid "Determines access to |LibTem|"
msgstr "Determina o acesso a |LibTem|"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:576
msgid ""
"|LibTem| is where Spec Templates, File Templates, Script Templates and "
"Security Packages are created and managed."
msgstr ""
"|LibTem| é onde Spec Templates, File Templates, Script Templates e Security "
"Packages são criados e gerenciados."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:577
msgid ""
"This permission is recommended for those responsible for creating and "
"managing Spec Templates, File Templates, Script Templates and Security "
"Packages."
msgstr ""
"Esta permissão é recomendada para those responsible for creating and "
"managing Spec Templates, File Templates, Script Templates and Security "
"Packages."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:579
msgid "Library: Thresholds (Formerly Provisioning: Thresholds)"
msgstr "Library: Thresholds (Anteriormente Provisioning: Thresholds)"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:581
msgid "Determines access to |LibAutSca|."
msgstr "Determina o acesso a |LibAutSca|."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:582
msgid ""
"Scale Thresholds is where preconfigured settings for auto-scaling Instances "
"are configured. When adding auto-scaling to an Instance, existing Scale "
"Thresholds can be selected to define auto-scaling rules."
msgstr ""
"Scale Thresholds é onde configurações pré-definidas para auto-escalonamento "
"de Instâncias são configuradas. Ao adicionar auto-escalonamento a uma "
"Instância, Scale Thresholds existentes podem ser selecionados para definir "
"regras de auto-escalonamento."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:583
msgid ""
"This permission is recommended for those responsible for defining auto-"
"scaling for Instances."
msgstr ""
"Esta permissão é recomendada para those responsible for defining auto-"
"scaling for Instances."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:584
msgid ""
"This permission is recommended to be set to None or Read on the Tenant Role "
"to restrict access for Subtenant users."
msgstr ""
"Recomenda-se que esta permissão seja definida como None or Read on the "
"Tenant Role to restrict access for Subtenant users."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:585
msgid "Library: Virtual Images (Formerly Provisioning: Virtual Images)"
msgstr "Library: Virtual Images (Anteriormente Provisioning: Virtual Images)"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:587
msgid ""
"Determines access to the :menuselection:`Library --> Virtual Images` page."
msgstr ""
"Determina o acesso a the :menuselection:`Library --> Virtual Images` page."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:588
msgid ""
":menuselection:`Library --> Virtual Images` is where user and system Virtual"
" Images are managed."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Library --> Virtual Images` é onde as Imagens Virtuais do "
"usuário e do sistema são gerenciadas."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:589
msgid ""
"This permission is recommended for those who are responsible for image "
"management."
msgstr ""
"Esta permissão é recomendada para those who are responsible for image "
"management."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:604
msgid "Environment Variables"
msgstr "Variáveis de Ambiente"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:605
#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:1048
msgid "None, User, Read, Full"
msgstr "None, User, Read, Full"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:606
msgid "Allows access to the Environments tab of the Instance detail page"
msgstr "Permite acesso a the Environments tab of the Instance detail page"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:607
msgid ""
"Allows Instance environment variables to be edited. If set to \"User\" level"
" only environment variables of Instances owned by the currently logged in "
"user may be edited."
msgstr ""
"Permite Instance environment variables to be edited. If set to \"User\" "
"level only environment variables of Instances owned by the currently logged "
"in user may be edited."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:608
#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:620
#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:626
#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:632
